{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33380","headline":"月中桂树 · 顾封人","name":"月中桂树","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芬馥天边桂，扶疎在月中。\n能齐大椿长，不与小山同。\n皎皎舒华色，亭亭丽碧空。\n亏盈宁委露，摇落不关风。\n岁晚花应发，春余质讵丰。\n无因遂攀赏，徒欲望青葱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾封人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33380.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33380","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}